00:49:04,000 --> 00:49:10,000
Xêr û xweşî... ev ne Qurtqulaqê mezin e, vîra dibên çûçik e?
Weqtî ne qirîne hatine we derê, çewa ye?
 
Goodness and happiness... is this not Big Qurtqulaq, they
call it the small one? When did they call it and come here,
how is it?

432
00:49:10,000 --> 00:49:14,000
Ne we ye, ev nav lê xistine Qurtqulaqa çûçik, ev ji
Qurtqulaqa mezin.
 
No, they named this one Little Qurtqulaq, and that one Big
Qurtqulaq.

433
00:49:14,000 --> 00:49:19,000
Silavên me ji miletê vî gundî re hene, tebîetekî çûçik ma
çavê gihiştiyê kêm heye.
 
We send our greetings to the people of this village, it has
a small nature but it is really beautiful to the eye.

434
00:49:19,000 --> 00:49:26,000
Ala Kurdistanê we a îd nêrozê me ji endek maye, em ê
înşalleh nêzîk da em ê îd nêroza xwa ji çêkin.
 
Your Kurdistan flag for the Newroz festival is still up, God
willing soon we will also celebrate our Newroz festival.

435
00:49:26,000 --> 00:49:29,000
Mentiqek xwaş bûye. Her derî xwaş bibe.
 
It has become a beautiful region. May everywhere be
beautiful.

436
00:49:29,000 --> 00:49:34,000
Em ê îd nêrozê we dîtin... em di... tu zane em ey mazlûm
cama... nuqte da me hev dîtibû.
 
We will see the Newroz festival... we are in... you know we
were in the Mazlum gathering... we had met at the point.

437
00:49:34,000 --> 00:49:36,000
E welle.
 
Yes, by God.

438
00:49:36,000 --> 00:49:38,000
Naka da em ê xwa bilivkînin.
 
Now we will get going.

439
00:49:38,000 --> 00:49:40,000
Tê me hoz bikirîya.
 
You should have informed us.

440
00:49:40,000 --> 00:49:47,000
Sal o çû ne... maşallah hinek ev qebr betîx e... welle em
qeçikê mezin kiştin dîmenê ke di nav genim de ketin...
 
Years have passed... mashallah some of these watermelon
stones... wow we filmed the big girl in the scene where they
fell into the wheat...

441
00:49:47,000 --> 00:49:50,000
Alem fetisî... bêje lî...
 
Everyone was breathless... say yes...

442
00:49:50,000 --> 00:49:52,000
Maşallah.
 
Mashallah.

443
00:49:52,000 --> 00:49:57,000
Vê ga Qurtqulaqê çûçik gi malbetên te nas kirin? Bi kîjan
malbetê tên naskirin?
 
Now, does Little Qurtqulaq know all your families? Which
family are they known by?

444
00:49:57,000 --> 00:50:00,000
Em di xwu ki Xelîkîn. Sê malbat na.
 
We are of the Xelîk tribe ourselves. There are three
families.

445
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:03,000
Erê, vî sê malbat, na yek, sê malê Waliya.
 
Yes, these three families, no, not one, three families of
Waliya.

446
00:50:03,000 --> 00:50:03,000
Erê malê Temir...
 
Waliya?

447
00:50:03,000 --> 00:50:05,000
Erê malê Temir...
 
Yes, the family of Temir...

448
00:50:05,000 --> 00:50:06,000
Û malê Hesûb.
 
And the family of Hesûb.

449
00:50:06,000 --> 00:50:07,000
Malê Hesûb.
 
The family of Hesûb.

450
00:50:07,000 --> 00:50:10,000
Silavên min ji vî malbatî re hene, çavê gişka maç dikim.
 
I send my greetings to this family, I kiss everyone's eyes.

451
00:50:10,000 --> 00:50:16,000
Silavên min ji miletê vî gundî re hene, çûçik, mezin, çavê
gişka maç dikim.
 
I send my greetings to the people of this village, young and
old, I kiss everyone's eyes.

452
00:50:16,000 --> 00:50:19,000
Xwedê destê xwe ser giya re bigire, xwedê giya bixefilîne.
 
May God protect them all, may God keep everyone safe.

453
00:50:19,000 --> 00:50:23,000
Xwedê nekin ber destan, xwedê rizqê giya bişîne.
 
May God not leave them in need, may God send everyone's
provision.

454
00:50:23,000 --> 00:50:26,000
Saeta te jî xweş, Xwedê ji te razî be.
 
Thank you too, may God be pleased with you.

455
00:50:26,000 --> 00:50:31,000
Û serkeftin bo jî wara... Û cejna... miletê me pîroz be
înşallah...
 
And success to them... And happy Eid... to our people,
hopefully...

456
00:50:31,000 --> 00:50:34,000
Wekî dibên cejna Newrozê li we pîroz be.
 
As they say, happy Newroz to you.

457
00:50:34,000 --> 00:50:37,000
Em pêşda wa be bêcûz em te nevînin. Newe?
 
We might be ahead of them, maybe we won't see you. Right?

458
00:50:37,000 --> 00:50:40,000
Xwedê ji te razî be... Ser çavên min...
 
May God be pleased with you... You're welcome...

459
00:50:40,000 --> 00:50:47,000
Xwedê ji te razî be... Ser serê min... Saet xweş...
 
May God be pleased with you... Upon my head... Thank you...

460
00:50:47,000 --> 00:50:51,000
Maşallah te çayek qeçxa kef kirîye... Pêşta te hesibîye...
 
Wow, you've made such a nice frothy tea... You planned it
beforehand...

461
00:50:51,000 --> 00:51:11,000
[Music]
 
[Music]

462
00:53:56,000 --> 00:54:00,000
Erê ev aliyê vira derkê jî em giştin dawiya vîdyoyê xwe.
 
Yes, for this side here as well, we have reached the end of
our video.

463
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:04,000
Heta gî çêbû vîdyo çêbû... rîk xirabe bî, em nekarin biçin
hundir malê.
 
As long as it was possible, the video was made... the road
was bad, we couldn't go inside the house.

464
00:54:04,000 --> 00:54:08,000
Erê. Îca yek mal xwiya nekitin. Qusûrê efû kin.
 
Yes. So one house didn't appear. Forgive the shortcoming.

465
00:54:08,000 --> 00:54:12,000
Em giştine derî wê, em nekarînin biçin hundir, dijwar e lê
xist.
 
We reached their door, we couldn't go inside, it was
difficult.

466
00:54:12,000 --> 00:54:15,000
Li vê derê em giştin dawiya vîdyoyê xwe. Çavê we gişka maç
dikim.
 
Here we have reached the end of our video. I kiss the eyes
of you all.

467
00:54:15,000 --> 00:54:20,000
Bîr nekin çend te'lîqan ji me re binivîsin, vîdyoyê me
bişixulînin.
 
Don't forget to write us some comments, share our video.

468
00:54:20,000 --> 00:54:24,000
Û înşallah, bi îzna Xwedê ta qeza neda, seke mecal ji me re
çêbî.
 
And hopefully, by God's permission, if nothing goes wrong,
if we get the chance.

469
00:54:24,000 --> 00:54:28,000
Ezê derkevim Qeredepê, min û gundîyê Qeredepê... ew li benda
min in.
 
I will go up to Qeredepe, me and the villagers of
Qeredepe... they are waiting for me.

470
00:54:28,000 --> 00:54:31,000
Ezê werim xelqeyekê Qeredepê jî çêkim.
 
I will come and make an episode for Qeredepe too.

471
00:54:31,000 --> 00:54:36,000
O nika me Qeparaw me sawirandin... Feqîr, qeloq, mezin û
çûçik jî me sawirandin...
 
Here now we have filmed Qeparaw... Poor, bald, old and
young, we filmed them too...

472
00:54:36,000 --> 00:54:40,000
Emê nika derbas bin... Seke mecal çêbî ezê Qeredepê jî
çêkim.
 
We will pass by now... If there is a chance, I will film
Qeredepe too.

473
00:54:40,000 --> 00:54:44,000
Le gundê malbat... ji me xwestine li gundê Qeredepê.
 
Because the families... wanted me in the village of
Qeredepe.

474
00:54:44,000 --> 00:54:49,000
Emê herin înşallah emê xelqeyekê li wir da çêkin, nêzîk da
înşallah.
 
We will go hopefully, we will make an episode there, soon
hopefully.

475
00:54:49,000 --> 00:54:54,000
Dê bi me re bin, saetên we xweş... çavê we gişka maç
dikim... bay bay.
 
So stay with us, have a good time... I kiss all your eyes...
bye bye.

